Confirm admin badges, \"Yangi Kitob Qo'shish\" button, PDF/ZIP cards, \"+ Audio\" button, and Delete button are visible.\n   - Test adding a new book with both PDF and Audio file.\n   - Test attaching an audio file to an existing book.\n   - Test playing the uploaded audio file in the modern player.\n   - Test deleting a book.\n","Description":"Create comprehensive implementation plan for fixing issues, adding audio book capabilities, enforcing admin-only permissions, and modernizing frontend.","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\Surface PC\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\9b93b8e7-46ce-437a-8ae9-cea474183c38\\implementation_plan.md","toolAction":"Creating implementation plan","toolSummary":"Create implementation plan"}}]}
